💭🔜
  Exchange: NsmEquities
  Feed: TotalView
  Reads: Nasdaq.NsmEquities.MatchingEngine.Ipc.v2026
  Writes: Nasdaq.NsmEquities.TotalView.Itch.v5.0.2026
  Generated. It reads the venue's own events, as the market beside it writes them, and writes each one the venue's transforms name as a packet of this feed, one message to a packet and one packet after another. The events to read are this program's first argument and the file to write is its second, because Emojicode has no standard input.
